sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Bibliophile
    participant VM as LibraryAppModel
    participant C as LibraryController
    participant S as MoveBookToShelfUseCase
    participant B as Book (Domain)
    participant R as BookRepository
    U->>VM: "To Owned" on a Wanted book
    VM-->>U: ask "Purchased or gifted?"
    U->>VM: chooseGifted(), then the giver's name
    VM->>C: move(isbn, OWNED, readingStatus, new Gift(giver))
    C->>S: execute(ownerId, isbn, OWNED, gift)
    S->>R: loadLibrary(ownerId)
    R-->>S: PersonalLibrary
    S->>B: acquire(gift)
    S->>B: moveTo(OWNED)
    Note right of B: rule: an Owned book needs a complete<br/>Purchase or Gift (a Gift needs a giver)
    alt acquisition missing or incomplete
        B-->>S: NotAcquiredError / GiftSourceRequiredError
        S-->>VM: error (nothing saved)
        VM-->>U: explain what is missing
    else rule satisfied
        S->>R: save(ownerId, book)
        R-->>S: Book
        S-->>C: Book
        C->>C: setReading(isbn, readingStatus)
        C-->>VM: Book
        VM-->>U: "Moved to Owned"
    end
